<Defs>

  <!--
    The heart's four needs (Source/ColonyCouncil/Heart/HeartNeeds.cs works out their values, 0 to 100, every hour; they
    are never saved and give no mood). Here: which wishes and life goals answer each one. For the need a colonist lacks
    most (below 45), these become up to 35% likelier, together with what their feelings ask for capped at half again.
    Names and descriptions are in Keyed/Rimfolk_Heart.xml (CC_Heart_Need_{need}).
  -->

